  "title": "Identification method of multi-degree-of-freedom systems based on fourier series",
  "abstract": "A time domain method of identification based on the Fourier series is presented. The formulation is derived for general second order linear time - invariant systems. Some simple applications are given to show the potential of the method for solving mechanical vibration problems.",
